1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,715
Afraid to speak English?

2
00:00:01,715 --> 00:00:02,756
Follow these rules.

3
00:00:02,756 --> 00:00:03,633
Do not skip one.

4
00:00:04,833 --> 00:00:07,027
When you make a mistake, keep talking.

5
00:00:07,027 --> 00:00:08,528
Do not stop and apologise.

6
00:00:08,528 --> 00:00:10,433
Nobody is counting your mistakes.

7
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:12,700
The daily protocol.

8
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,768
Talk to the mirror.

9
00:00:13,768 --> 00:00:14,779
Record your voice.

10
00:00:14,779 --> 00:00:15,454
Listen back.

11
00:00:15,454 --> 00:00:17,533
And never wait until you are perfect.

12
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:19,753
Rule number three.

13
00:00:19,753 --> 00:00:21,453
Do not translate in your head.

14
00:00:21,453 --> 00:00:22,813
Think in simple English.

15
00:00:22,813 --> 00:00:24,399
Follow for rule number four.

